WEBVTT

01:35.759 --> 01:38.280
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.420 --> 01:41.280
[Episode 8]

01:41.710 --> 01:42.560
What kind of perm

01:42.560 --> 01:43.430
would you like, handsome?

01:43.430 --> 01:45.509
I want something...

01:45.509 --> 01:47.430
understated yet stylish—

01:47.430 --> 01:48.590
something fresh

01:48.590 --> 01:51.070
yet striking.

01:51.789 --> 01:52.920
Sure, we can do that!

02:13.740 --> 02:16.130
[Full scholarship admission
decision letter from a U.S. University]

02:14.520 --> 02:16.720
Doesn't meet admission requirements.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.760
I think I've got something in my eye.

02:58.760 --> 02:59.840
Don't touch it!

02:59.840 --> 03:00.840
Let me see!

03:05.030 --> 03:06.360
There's nothing there.

03:06.430 --> 03:07.490
Do you feel better?

03:08.780 --> 03:12.850
♪ Watching your profile draw near,
I smile like a fool ♪

03:13.450 --> 03:17.120
♪ Every word you said, like a melody,
sprouts in my heart ♪

03:17.930 --> 03:21.950
♪ The sparks between us
burn bright within the notes ♪

03:21.630 --> 03:22.710
I-I'll go put in some eye drops.

03:22.400 --> 03:26.250
♪ How I long for an answer from you ♪

03:22.710 --> 03:23.710
That should help.

03:26.579 --> 03:28.600
♪ My heart won't stop its racing beat ♪

03:29.040 --> 03:31.450
♪ The sweetness when our eyes meet ♪

03:31.940 --> 03:35.610
♪ Each time we meet,
it's as if the dream goes on ♪

03:32.960 --> 03:33.680
Catch it!

03:36.010 --> 03:38.200
♪ How I wish to tell you ♪

03:36.560 --> 03:37.430
Be careful!

03:37.750 --> 03:38.870
Be careful!

03:38.360 --> 03:40.579
♪ It's not a coincidence or a miracle ♪

03:42.650 --> 03:45.410
♪ It's destiny ♪

03:44.870 --> 03:45.630
Time's almost up.

03:45.620 --> 03:47.470
♪ Sharing my earbuds with you ♪

03:45.630 --> 03:46.310
We should head back to class.

03:46.310 --> 03:47.400
Mr. Bu, class hasn't even started yet.

03:47.400 --> 03:47.870
Let us play a bit longer.

03:47.490 --> 03:49.630
♪ Connecting you to my heartbeat ♪

03:47.890 --> 03:48.590
Just a bit.

03:48.630 --> 03:49.690
Alright, alright.

03:49.690 --> 03:51.740
♪ Scrolling up and down the playlist ♪

03:49.800 --> 03:50.520
Be careful.

03:50.550 --> 03:51.110
Okay.

03:51.829 --> 03:55.210
♪ Disrupting the rhythm of my breath ♪

03:53.450 --> 03:55.120
Our current students

03:55.250 --> 03:56.220
are in their senior year.

03:55.420 --> 03:59.320
♪ On repeat, the song
tells the secret I can't speak ♪

03:56.360 --> 03:58.190
Even though they're in the middle of
the final push,

03:58.190 --> 03:59.750
the overall study atmosphere

03:59.430 --> 04:00.980
♪ The smile at the corner of your lips ♪

03:59.930 --> 04:00.760
-is very good.
-Hello, teachers!

04:00.760 --> 04:01.630
Hello, hello.

04:02.150 --> 04:02.950
It's just that

04:03.060 --> 04:04.750
during the breaks,

04:05.070 --> 04:06.330
things get a bit loose.

04:07.100 --> 04:07.580
Bu Guo,

04:08.630 --> 04:10.230
your observation is spot on.

04:10.790 --> 04:12.660
I've noticed that too.

04:13.140 --> 04:14.980
Our college admission rate
has declined a bit

04:14.980 --> 04:16.339
over the past couple of years.

04:16.339 --> 04:16.990
This year,

04:17.339 --> 04:18.940
we need to tighten things up.

04:19.430 --> 04:19.959
Let's go.

04:22.100 --> 04:26.230
[Bulletin Board]

04:24.640 --> 04:26.220
Excuse me, excuse me.

04:26.700 --> 04:28.260
Thank you, thank you.

04:31.210 --> 04:32.950
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

04:32.780 --> 04:33.510
Isn't this the school's

04:33.510 --> 04:35.040
annual grand celebration?

04:35.900 --> 04:37.340
It's our last year at school.

04:37.340 --> 04:38.870
Let's join together, okay?

04:40.260 --> 04:40.820
Ning,

04:41.140 --> 04:41.990
let's do a double cello performance.

04:41.990 --> 04:42.780
What do you think?

04:42.780 --> 04:43.580
Let's do it?

04:44.260 --> 04:45.460
We haven't performed in ages.

04:45.460 --> 04:47.120
We should show off our skills.

04:47.220 --> 04:47.950
Take a look.

04:47.690 --> 04:49.090
[Selection List for the Experimental Class
of Qingmu High School]

04:48.780 --> 04:49.990
This experimental class

04:49.990 --> 04:51.900
is a pilot program for our school.

04:50.340 --> 04:51.850
[Selection List for the Experimental Class
of Qingmu High School]

04:51.900 --> 04:53.460
We will select the top 30 students

04:53.460 --> 04:54.700
in the grade,

04:54.900 --> 04:57.140
who will be taught by a team of

04:57.140 --> 04:58.460
senior teachers and subject experts

04:58.460 --> 04:59.380
for one month.

05:00.140 --> 05:01.670
But our ultimate goal

05:01.670 --> 05:03.460
is to provide all students

05:03.460 --> 05:05.410
with a more focused

05:05.430 --> 05:07.990
and efficient learning environment.

05:09.510 --> 05:10.430
I'll leave it to you.

05:10.430 --> 05:11.160
Director Hu!

05:12.260 --> 05:13.320
About Tong Xiaole.

05:13.900 --> 05:14.990
You know

05:14.990 --> 05:15.580
his grades,

05:15.580 --> 05:16.670
but I've been

05:17.380 --> 05:19.310
teaching him since his first year.

05:19.700 --> 05:20.630
His personality

05:21.220 --> 05:22.070
is a bit...

05:23.460 --> 05:24.460
a bit rebellious.

05:24.580 --> 05:25.460
So I'm worried

05:25.900 --> 05:26.750
he might

05:26.830 --> 05:28.430
struggle with a new teacher,

05:28.700 --> 05:30.190
and his grades might suffer.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.050
How about this?

05:32.140 --> 05:34.140
I promise you—

05:34.340 --> 05:35.020
if

05:35.550 --> 05:37.080
you let him stay in my class,

05:37.110 --> 05:38.220
I guarantee his grades

05:38.220 --> 05:41.110
will remain stable
until the college entrance exam.

05:41.110 --> 05:41.700
Mr. Bu,

05:42.460 --> 05:43.920
I understand how you feel.

05:44.550 --> 05:45.190
But the teachers

05:45.190 --> 05:47.020
for our experimental class are

05:47.020 --> 05:49.420
all specially certified senior teachers.

05:49.460 --> 05:51.590
They're certainly more experienced.

05:52.110 --> 05:52.909
It'll be fine.

05:53.900 --> 05:54.700
Don't worry.

05:55.340 --> 05:56.700
Think it over.

06:00.750 --> 06:02.680
Everyone, stop what you're doing.

06:09.820 --> 06:10.950
Starting tomorrow,

06:12.260 --> 06:13.720
all senior-year students

06:14.550 --> 06:16.020
must arrive before 6 a.m.

06:16.020 --> 06:17.420
for morning self-study.

06:17.900 --> 06:18.780
Six a.m.?

06:19.340 --> 06:21.460
And all extracurricular club activities

06:21.460 --> 06:23.920
for senior-year students will be canceled.

06:24.670 --> 06:25.820
Ning, what about our...

06:25.820 --> 06:27.260
All students will

06:27.700 --> 06:31.260
return to school for review sessions
after school and on weekends.

06:31.260 --> 06:32.340
No one

06:32.580 --> 06:35.670
will be permitted to take leave
under any circumstances.

06:35.670 --> 06:36.700
We can't even take leave?

06:36.700 --> 06:38.190
What if we get sick?

06:39.340 --> 06:39.990
Quiet.

06:40.340 --> 06:42.340
The following students, please stand up

06:42.340 --> 06:43.600
when I call your names:

06:44.510 --> 06:45.220
Luo Ningzi,

06:48.780 --> 06:49.670
Tong Xiaole,

06:54.510 --> 06:55.370
Chen Guoqiang,

06:57.110 --> 06:57.900
Wei Hu,

06:59.310 --> 07:00.190
and Chen Chen.

07:02.380 --> 07:03.140
You...

07:04.020 --> 07:05.820
will be assigned to the Experimental Class

07:05.820 --> 07:06.950
to study for a month.

07:07.340 --> 07:08.780
The Experimental Class?

07:08.990 --> 07:09.900
Mr. Bu,

07:09.900 --> 07:11.020
why are we being split into
different classes?

07:11.020 --> 07:12.110
Shouldn't you discuss

07:12.110 --> 07:13.340
something like this with us first?

07:13.340 --> 07:14.140
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

07:14.140 --> 07:15.220
This isn't fair at all,

07:15.220 --> 07:15.990
Mr. Bu!

07:16.220 --> 07:17.220
It's unfair!

07:18.110 --> 07:18.990
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

07:19.220 --> 07:20.020
Quiet!

07:21.620 --> 07:23.280
The school made this decision

07:23.460 --> 07:24.580
to help you

07:24.900 --> 07:27.230
give it your all in the final push

07:27.340 --> 07:29.270
toward the college entrance exam.

07:29.900 --> 07:31.960
And we also hope that you'll maintain

07:32.460 --> 07:34.820
an appropriate distance
in your interactions

07:34.820 --> 07:36.140
with students of the opposite sex.

07:36.140 --> 07:38.580
There's nothing going on between us,
so what distance are you talking about?

07:38.580 --> 07:39.700
Crazy.

07:48.140 --> 07:48.780
Yi Lan!

07:50.020 --> 07:51.140
What took you so long?

07:51.140 --> 07:52.670
Have you been waiting long?

07:54.190 --> 07:55.260
I won't hold you up.

07:55.260 --> 07:56.190
You two in front,

07:56.780 --> 07:57.780
stop right there!

07:57.780 --> 07:58.380
Come here!

07:59.230 --> 08:00.580
Don't you know boys and girls

08:00.580 --> 08:01.980
can't share an umbrella?

08:02.220 --> 08:03.280
Are you two dating?

08:04.460 --> 08:05.720
Which class are you in?

08:06.140 --> 08:08.700
School rules don't allow boys and girls to
share an umbrella!

08:08.700 --> 08:09.870
Come on! Come here.

08:11.020 --> 08:11.960
Remember, from now on,

08:11.960 --> 08:13.070
you can't share an umbrella.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.270
What should we do now?

08:14.700 --> 08:15.260
Let's go.

08:15.380 --> 08:15.990
Let's go!

08:16.190 --> 08:17.460
Remember this.

08:27.110 --> 08:29.140
Why did you snatch my umbrella?

08:29.340 --> 08:30.550
My hair is all wet!

08:31.330 --> 08:31.810
Shan...

08:41.669 --> 08:42.950
Shan!

08:43.010 --> 08:45.930
-Shan! Shan!
-Shan!

08:45.950 --> 08:47.210
-Where are you?
-Shan?

08:48.220 --> 08:48.950
There's a towel in the cabinet.

08:48.950 --> 08:49.810
Help yourself.

08:50.220 --> 08:50.980
Got it.

08:58.860 --> 09:00.790
When did they leave the money here?

09:13.100 --> 09:13.860
You actually

09:13.860 --> 09:15.520
don't look half bad like this.

09:18.820 --> 09:19.500
Dry off quickly.

09:19.500 --> 09:20.560
Don't catch a cold.

09:30.220 --> 09:31.310
Why are your exam papers

09:31.310 --> 09:32.620
different from ours?

09:33.100 --> 09:34.700
It's just different classes—

09:34.700 --> 09:37.230
is there really a need
for unequal treatment?

09:38.070 --> 09:39.270
Then you finish them.

09:42.620 --> 09:43.270
No need.

09:50.430 --> 09:53.430
Did they call you in
to discuss college applications?

09:55.460 --> 09:56.720
Hailan University...

09:57.430 --> 09:58.890
Photography Department.

09:59.950 --> 10:00.950
Photography Department?

10:00.950 --> 10:01.880
You've decided?

10:05.460 --> 10:06.980
But why Hailan University?

10:06.980 --> 10:07.860
With your grades,

10:07.860 --> 10:10.270
shouldn't you be aiming for
a more competitive school?

10:10.270 --> 10:11.870
Because you're going there.

10:12.100 --> 10:13.900
What does that have to do with me?

10:15.700 --> 10:16.430
I'm worried that

10:16.430 --> 10:17.820
after you go to Hailan University,

10:17.820 --> 10:19.460
you'll get pushed around.

10:19.460 --> 10:20.150
And without me to protect you,

10:20.150 --> 10:21.080
what will you do?

10:21.100 --> 10:22.630
Who are you looking down on?

10:25.820 --> 10:26.740
So impressive.

10:27.430 --> 10:28.190
You bet.

10:30.700 --> 10:32.030
Let me show you something.

10:32.030 --> 10:32.500
What?

10:35.340 --> 10:36.150
Of course, it's the photo

10:36.150 --> 10:38.340
I took specifically of you that day,

10:38.340 --> 10:40.580
and I developed it specifically...

10:41.220 --> 10:42.460
just to give to you.

10:42.820 --> 10:44.350
Handsome, don't you think?

10:48.460 --> 10:49.310
Smile.

11:04.950 --> 11:06.410
You're only noticing now?

11:07.070 --> 11:09.860
You've only captured
a fraction of my charm.

11:09.950 --> 11:11.390
I-I-It's not bad.

11:16.620 --> 11:17.500
So handsome.

11:20.950 --> 11:22.310
Actually, I...

11:24.580 --> 11:25.790
I know that day

11:26.100 --> 11:26.980
you were trying to help me

11:26.980 --> 11:28.820
be firmer about my photography dream,

11:28.820 --> 11:30.480
so you invited everyone over.

11:30.980 --> 11:31.740
Thank you.

11:34.190 --> 11:35.740
No need to thank me!

11:35.950 --> 11:37.670
We're friends!

11:38.460 --> 11:39.840
I've always known about

11:39.980 --> 11:41.510
your dream of photography,

11:41.580 --> 11:44.100
so of course, I'd go all out for you.

11:48.820 --> 11:49.740
It's my dream.

11:49.740 --> 11:51.070
Why are you so happy?

11:51.620 --> 11:52.550
Of course.

11:52.950 --> 11:55.680
You were so indecisive
about choosing a major...

12:02.290 --> 12:04.270
[Solution]

12:44.220 --> 12:44.670
Hurry up,

12:44.670 --> 12:45.800
we're gonna be late!

12:47.460 --> 12:49.700
Why don't you go by yourself today?

12:49.700 --> 12:50.980
I'm not going.

12:51.070 --> 12:51.870
What's wrong?

12:52.190 --> 12:53.340
Are you not feeling well?

12:53.340 --> 12:55.070
Did you catch a cold yesterday?

12:56.820 --> 12:57.550
You're fine.

13:00.580 --> 13:01.820
I didn't finish my homework.

13:01.820 --> 13:02.980
Mr. Bu said anyone who doesn't finish it

13:02.980 --> 13:04.100
has to run 5,000 meters as punishment.

13:04.100 --> 13:06.160
I'll be half dead after running that.

13:06.340 --> 13:07.540
I'm really not going.

13:10.070 --> 13:10.820
Turn around.

13:15.580 --> 13:16.620
Will you be late?

13:16.620 --> 13:17.700
Do you want to go ahead?

13:17.700 --> 13:18.220
No.

13:19.340 --> 13:20.460
Then write faster.

13:20.980 --> 13:22.190
Make it look like I wrote it!

13:22.190 --> 13:22.980
Shut up.

13:23.100 --> 13:25.270
Keep talking, and we really will be late.

13:25.270 --> 13:26.340
Don't get them all correct...

13:26.340 --> 13:26.820
Done.

13:28.980 --> 13:29.510
Let's go.

13:30.820 --> 13:32.150
You're amazing!

13:33.220 --> 13:34.100
Get on the bike, hurry.

13:34.100 --> 13:34.950
Or we'll really be late.

13:34.950 --> 13:36.350
You really are a prodigy.

13:38.980 --> 13:39.740
Which class are you in?

13:39.740 --> 13:40.340
Class 9.

13:40.430 --> 13:42.460
Don't you know
badminton rackets aren't allowed?

13:42.460 --> 13:43.990
This isn't allowed either.

13:48.270 --> 13:49.000
Which class?

13:49.100 --> 13:49.950
Experimental Class.

13:49.950 --> 13:51.030
Experimental Class?

13:51.030 --> 13:51.580
Go ahead.

13:52.100 --> 13:53.700
Thank you for your hard work.

13:54.220 --> 13:54.950
Which class?

13:55.070 --> 13:57.100
-Class 9.
-Who told you that you could eat?

13:57.100 --> 13:57.980
Where's your phone?

13:57.980 --> 13:58.500
Didn't bring it.

13:58.500 --> 13:59.340
I didn't bring it.

13:59.340 --> 14:01.820
Basketballs aren't allowed either,
you know that?

14:01.820 --> 14:02.550
Hand it over.

14:03.820 --> 14:04.740
We used to be allowed to bring them,

14:04.740 --> 14:05.850
and now we're not?

14:07.430 --> 14:08.030
Forget it.

14:08.460 --> 14:09.340
Students,

14:09.820 --> 14:12.020
what I'm about to say is very important.

14:12.100 --> 14:12.820
We've

14:12.820 --> 14:14.980
figured out 80% of the questions
that are likely

14:14.980 --> 14:16.180
to appear on the exam.

14:16.340 --> 14:16.980
Write

14:17.190 --> 14:18.820
them down now, alright?

14:32.490 --> 14:37.700
[Pass through a straight line;
A point not on the line]

14:35.740 --> 14:36.700
Look at your textbooks.

14:36.700 --> 14:38.360
The blackboard is over there.

14:41.070 --> 14:42.740
Male and female students are forbidden...

14:42.740 --> 14:44.200
from walking side by side.

14:46.050 --> 14:47.460
No basketball?

14:46.270 --> 14:47.990
[Qingmu High School
Evening Self-Study Regulations (2022)]

14:48.310 --> 14:49.770
No strolling on the track?

14:52.860 --> 14:54.910
Why are there so many stupid rules?

14:55.060 --> 14:57.170
[Qingmu High School
Evening Self-Study Regulations (2022)]

14:55.580 --> 14:56.780
Especially this one—

14:56.820 --> 14:58.670
no food allowed in school.

14:57.190 --> 14:58.580
[Qingmu High School
Evening Self-Study Regulations (2022)]

14:58.950 --> 14:59.620
I can't believe it.

14:59.620 --> 15:01.460
I'm starving every day.

15:02.500 --> 15:03.790
Is there such a rule?

15:06.100 --> 15:09.230
You guys in the Experimental Class
don't have that rule?

15:09.620 --> 15:10.340
No.

15:11.740 --> 15:12.430
I want one too.

15:12.430 --> 15:13.550
It's unfair.

15:13.850 --> 15:16.510
This is clearly targeting
our regular classes.

15:21.580 --> 15:22.150
Let's go.

15:23.980 --> 15:24.790
Go. Go.

15:50.460 --> 15:51.460
Mr. Bu, my stomach hurts.

15:51.460 --> 15:52.990
I need to go to the bathroom.

15:53.340 --> 15:54.000
Go quickly.

16:08.460 --> 16:10.070
Mr. Bu, she has a headache.

16:15.580 --> 16:18.500
Mr. Bu, I want to go back early

16:18.500 --> 16:19.910
and rest a bit.

16:24.910 --> 16:27.110
Then just sleep on your desk for a while.

16:28.190 --> 16:28.860
You too.

16:30.620 --> 16:31.340
Hurry.

16:35.790 --> 16:36.520
Keep it down.

16:48.070 --> 16:48.580
Mr. Bu.

16:59.480 --> 17:00.580
Is the bubble tea here?

17:00.580 --> 17:01.710
It's here. Let's go.

17:18.630 --> 17:19.910
Does everyone have one?

17:19.910 --> 17:21.630
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

17:21.839 --> 17:23.329
[Experimental Class]

17:39.780 --> 17:41.430
As expected of the Experimental Class—

17:41.430 --> 17:42.630
look at their energy.

17:42.740 --> 17:44.400
No one even dares to slack off.

17:44.910 --> 17:46.740
And they each have a cup of bubble tea,

17:46.740 --> 17:48.140
given out by the teacher.

17:52.980 --> 17:55.150
Why don't they have all those rules?

17:56.630 --> 17:58.760
Aren't we being treated differently?

17:59.730 --> 18:00.580
Of course.

18:01.190 --> 18:03.540
The school favors these top students.

18:03.850 --> 18:06.190
We just get spoon-fed education,

18:06.260 --> 18:09.020
while they enjoy VIP treatment.

18:09.070 --> 18:10.910
Top students, top students,

18:11.260 --> 18:12.190
top students...

18:26.120 --> 18:27.450
What are you doing here?

18:29.260 --> 18:30.460
It's you three again.

18:31.060 --> 18:32.920
What are you sneaking around for?

18:32.980 --> 18:33.740
Director Hu,

18:34.060 --> 18:35.500
why do they get drinks

18:35.500 --> 18:36.460
and we don't?

18:36.630 --> 18:37.360
It's unfair!

18:38.630 --> 18:40.470
Then what are you holding in your hands?

18:40.470 --> 18:41.470
Still not enough?

18:42.500 --> 18:43.190
And you two?

18:43.430 --> 18:44.630
I'm an art student.

18:44.780 --> 18:46.710
I was just going to practice cello.

18:47.190 --> 18:49.450
Which university do you plan to apply to?

18:49.980 --> 18:51.110
Hailan University.

18:51.190 --> 18:52.630
Hailan University's
academic score requirement

18:52.630 --> 18:53.590
is so high.

18:53.910 --> 18:54.700
Shouldn't you focus more

18:54.700 --> 18:55.630
on studying?

19:05.430 --> 19:06.950
It feels so good!

19:07.150 --> 19:09.410
I haven't had anything this good in ages!

19:09.460 --> 19:11.060
We get up at the crack of dawn.

19:11.110 --> 19:11.590
Yeah.

19:11.630 --> 19:13.060
And we have evening self-study every day!

19:13.060 --> 19:13.630
Yeah.

19:13.670 --> 19:15.110
I'm practically dead on my feet!

19:15.110 --> 19:15.710
Same here.

19:15.870 --> 19:18.470
When do we even have time
for our major classes?

19:19.220 --> 19:20.350
We're so miserable!

19:23.390 --> 19:24.430
Indeed.

19:24.670 --> 19:25.740
Even though we're in different classes,

19:25.740 --> 19:28.390
the treatment shouldn't be so different.

19:29.540 --> 19:31.630
We've been working hard for so long,

19:31.690 --> 19:33.150
yet we can't even perform
at the anniversary celebration!

19:33.150 --> 19:33.700
Yeah!

19:33.700 --> 19:35.190
Why can't we perform at the anniversary?

19:35.190 --> 19:35.910
Yeah!

19:35.910 --> 19:37.700
We have to participate in
this anniversary!

19:37.700 --> 19:38.630
It's not fair!

19:38.630 --> 19:40.300
We have to do this
for all the senior students

19:40.300 --> 19:41.190
who didn't get into
the Experimental Class—

19:41.190 --> 19:42.150
the ones with average grades!

19:42.150 --> 19:42.830
Like me!

19:42.830 --> 19:43.540
Like me!

19:43.540 --> 19:44.220
Like me!

19:44.220 --> 19:45.120
And me!

19:45.140 --> 19:46.390
-Not you!
-Not you!

19:48.060 --> 19:50.120
We must speak out against injustice!

19:50.390 --> 19:51.150
-Speak out!
-Speak out!

19:51.150 --> 19:53.980
-Speak out!
-Speak out!

19:55.430 --> 19:56.220
-Impressive!
-Impressive!

19:56.220 --> 19:57.880
I didn't know you had it in you!

19:58.350 --> 19:59.350
You bet.

19:59.390 --> 20:00.980
I didn't expect you to be a pro.

20:00.980 --> 20:02.230
When did you compose this behind my back?

20:02.230 --> 20:04.290
There's a lot you don't know about me.

20:04.290 --> 20:06.590
[I Believe in You]

20:04.630 --> 20:05.950
Enough, enough.

20:06.150 --> 20:08.150
Since we're performing together,

20:08.300 --> 20:10.360
shouldn't we coordinate in advance?

20:15.780 --> 20:17.910
How about we ask the school orchestra?

20:18.620 --> 20:20.970
[I Believe in You]

20:18.700 --> 20:19.590
Didn't you two want to

20:19.590 --> 20:20.990
play the cello together?

20:22.460 --> 20:23.720
The school orchestra?

20:26.190 --> 20:27.430
I support it, I support it!

20:27.430 --> 20:30.120
[I Believe in You]

20:33.700 --> 20:34.560
It's like this.

20:35.260 --> 20:35.950
Yeah.

20:37.110 --> 20:38.700
We're all afraid of Director Hu.

20:38.700 --> 20:40.630
You guys will graduate
after the college entrance exam,

20:40.630 --> 20:42.300
but we still have another year here.

20:42.300 --> 20:43.230
We really can't.

20:43.520 --> 20:45.700
Just because you have another year left,

20:45.700 --> 20:46.390
are you willing to

20:46.390 --> 20:48.320
put up with a senior year like ours?

20:48.910 --> 20:49.950
Junior,

20:50.350 --> 20:52.190
we need to stand united in this.

21:02.540 --> 21:03.430
How did it go?

21:04.540 --> 21:05.390
He said no.

21:08.350 --> 21:09.150
Why?

21:10.390 --> 21:11.590
I don't know.

21:17.460 --> 21:18.460
What should we do?

21:26.540 --> 21:28.460
I thought of someone who can help.

21:28.630 --> 21:29.220
Who?

21:29.390 --> 21:29.870
Who?

21:29.950 --> 21:30.390
Who?

21:30.980 --> 21:31.870
Who?

21:44.300 --> 21:45.230
Problem solved.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.390
You're good,

21:46.390 --> 21:47.590
Zhao Zhenghao!

21:47.780 --> 21:48.870
Piece of cake.

21:49.390 --> 21:50.300
But

21:50.300 --> 21:51.910
aren't you afraid of getting punished?

21:51.910 --> 21:54.460
Someone has to step up.

21:54.910 --> 21:56.970
We wouldn't do this if we were scared.

22:05.130 --> 22:06.460
[Class 9, Grade 12]

22:07.260 --> 22:08.660
Let me ask you something.

22:09.190 --> 22:10.300
Uh...

22:10.330 --> 22:12.460
Yi Lan, Qiao Mengmeng, Chen Fan—

22:13.060 --> 22:13.920
where are they?

22:14.300 --> 22:15.060
Mr. Bu,

22:15.430 --> 22:16.890
they didn't come in today.

22:17.910 --> 22:20.440
Mr. Bu, I don't know
how to solve this problem.

22:26.390 --> 22:27.150
Mr. Bu.

22:27.950 --> 22:29.410
I saw Yi Lan and the others.

22:37.970 --> 22:40.670
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

22:43.090 --> 22:45.450
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

22:54.580 --> 22:55.770
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

23:18.450 --> 23:20.000
Dear alumni,

23:19.930 --> 23:24.010
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

23:20.020 --> 23:21.110
teachers,

23:21.230 --> 23:22.430
and fellow students,

23:22.640 --> 23:23.990
hello!

23:24.110 --> 23:26.740
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

23:24.110 --> 23:27.110
-Hello!
-Yeah!

23:27.630 --> 23:30.250
Today, I'm deeply gratified to see
all faculty and students

23:30.250 --> 23:32.150
gathered here with enthusiasm and respect

23:32.150 --> 23:33.260
to witness

23:33.440 --> 23:36.200
an extraordinary moment—

23:36.280 --> 23:38.170
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

23:36.590 --> 23:38.540
the 75th anniversary

23:38.540 --> 23:40.630
of Qingmu High School!

23:40.570 --> 23:42.050
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

23:44.620 --> 23:47.850
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

23:46.190 --> 23:48.150
As a key school in the city,

23:47.950 --> 23:49.220
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

23:48.150 --> 23:49.430
since its founding,

23:49.630 --> 23:51.780
the school has upheld its motto—
Through Virtue,

23:51.780 --> 23:53.390
Toward Excellence—

23:53.540 --> 23:54.980
and has continued to forge ahead.

23:54.980 --> 23:57.390
While reaching new heights in academics,

23:57.460 --> 24:00.120
the arts have also blossomed
brilliantly here.

24:00.300 --> 24:02.150
Especially our school orchestra—

24:02.150 --> 24:05.390
Mumu Bang!

24:06.870 --> 24:10.070
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

24:12.060 --> 24:15.110
Now, please enjoy a duet cello performance

24:15.110 --> 24:17.780
by Mumu Bang.

24:18.150 --> 24:19.060
Applause!

24:19.850 --> 24:21.530
[School Celebration; Celebrating the
75th Anniversary of Qingmu High School]

24:21.650 --> 24:22.650
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

25:06.750 --> 25:08.320
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

25:28.500 --> 25:29.400
[Celebrating the 75th Anniversary
of Qingmu High School]

25:30.670 --> 25:31.630
Bravo!

25:32.560 --> 25:33.520
Bravo!

25:42.300 --> 25:43.700
Yi Lan is good!

25:50.430 --> 25:51.390
Next,

25:51.390 --> 25:54.350
we have our musical talent Chen Fan

25:54.380 --> 25:56.510
bringing us an original composition—

25:56.590 --> 25:59.790
the most soul-stirring sound
from the heart of the earth.

26:00.980 --> 26:03.300
Let's welcome Chen Fan!

26:05.110 --> 26:06.460
Chen Fan!

26:06.490 --> 26:07.400
Chen Fan!

26:07.420 --> 26:08.350
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:08.350 --> 26:09.360
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:09.360 --> 26:10.450
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:10.450 --> 26:11.330
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:11.330 --> 26:12.330
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:12.330 --> 26:13.230
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:13.230 --> 26:14.430
-Chen Fan!
-Chen Fan!

26:25.480 --> 26:28.050
♪ She left in spring ♪

26:29.040 --> 26:31.920
♪ Gone with her was cherry blossoms ♪

26:32.600 --> 26:35.050
♪ On the once youthful face ♪

26:36.240 --> 26:38.920
♪ There were tears amidst confusion ♪

26:39.800 --> 26:42.070
♪ She left in spring ♪

26:43.140 --> 26:45.750
♪ All was like a dream ♪

26:46.520 --> 26:49.200
♪ Youth never lasts ♪

26:50.700 --> 26:53.180
♪ Just let her go ♪

26:54.310 --> 26:56.410
♪ The paper plane that was once set free ♪

26:56.610 --> 27:00.040
♪ Will find its way back
to the old desk and chair at school ♪

27:00.300 --> 27:03.360
♪ All stories have yet to end ♪

27:03.760 --> 27:05.130
♪ Let me write for you ♪

27:05.190 --> 27:08.920
♪ An old CD will witness
our ever-ending dreams ♪

27:09.130 --> 27:12.180
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

27:12.270 --> 27:15.460
♪ In which everyone has fun till the end ♪

27:15.490 --> 27:18.950
♪ It's a pity time always sneaks away ♪

27:19.050 --> 27:21.730
♪ Leaving behind so many headaches ♪

27:21.780 --> 27:23.370
♪ We never had the time to look back on ♪

27:23.400 --> 27:26.260
♪ Youth is nothing but a farce ♪

27:26.380 --> 27:29.470
♪ We live it wholeheartedly ♪

27:29.540 --> 27:33.340
♪ Joy and sorrow are woven together ♪

27:33.420 --> 27:37.000
♪ Every experience will bring me closer ♪

27:37.150 --> 27:38.950
♪ To myself ♪

28:03.910 --> 28:05.280
-Mumu Bang!
-Mumu Bang!

28:05.300 --> 28:06.610
-Mumu Bang!
-Mumu Bang!

28:06.610 --> 28:07.810
-Mumu Bang!
-Mumu Bang!

28:07.810 --> 28:09.060
-Mumu Bang!
-Mumu Bang!

28:09.060 --> 28:10.390
-Mumu Bang!
-Mumu Bang!

28:10.740 --> 28:13.390
Your actions have seriously violated
school rules!

28:13.390 --> 28:15.460
You not only disrupted
the normal order of the school

28:15.460 --> 28:16.460
but also set a very bad example

28:16.460 --> 28:17.740
for other students!

28:18.150 --> 28:19.280
You must be punished

28:19.460 --> 28:20.740
or even suspended!

28:21.350 --> 28:22.670
D-Director Hu,

28:23.020 --> 28:24.880
these kids just performed a show.

28:24.910 --> 28:26.390
They're under so much pressure.

28:26.390 --> 28:27.780
Just give them a lecture.

28:27.780 --> 28:28.910
There's no need to suspend them.

28:28.910 --> 28:29.630
Mr. Bu,

28:30.150 --> 28:31.610
I understand how you feel.

28:31.950 --> 28:33.390
But rules are rules.

28:33.950 --> 28:35.410
Disciplinary violations

28:35.700 --> 28:37.360
must be dealt with seriously!

28:37.390 --> 28:39.220
But the college entrance exam
is coming up.

28:39.220 --> 28:39.870
Enough.

28:41.740 --> 28:43.390
Director Hu, our behavior

28:43.390 --> 28:44.790
was indeed a bit extreme.

28:44.980 --> 28:46.670
We were just trying to

28:46.670 --> 28:48.220
make our voices heard.

28:48.780 --> 28:50.220
We're only asking to be

28:50.980 --> 28:53.440
treated equally, regardless of our grades.

28:56.700 --> 28:58.910
Tong Xiaole, if you put it that way...

29:03.500 --> 29:06.350
I think what Tong Xiaole said
is worth reflecting on.

29:06.350 --> 29:07.190
Our education

29:07.460 --> 29:09.840
should indeed be more humanized.

29:16.670 --> 29:18.540
After careful reflection,
the School Committee

29:18.540 --> 29:21.190
acknowledges
that this decision was flawed.

29:21.550 --> 29:22.500
Any reform

29:22.500 --> 29:23.190
must be grounded

29:23.190 --> 29:26.590
in respect for students
and an understanding of their needs.

29:26.700 --> 29:29.760
Therefore, we have decided to
revoke the new rules,

29:29.870 --> 29:31.070
restore the old ones,

29:31.540 --> 29:33.340
cancel the Experimental Class,

29:34.150 --> 29:36.010
and ensure that all classes

29:36.350 --> 29:39.130
receive equal attention and resources.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.670
We will also make sure

29:41.670 --> 29:43.000
every student is heard.

29:43.760 --> 29:45.260
So the perks of the Experimental Class
are gone!

29:45.260 --> 29:46.460
What am I supposed to do?

29:46.460 --> 29:47.700
Shut up!

29:47.700 --> 29:48.950
Get out of here!

29:49.020 --> 29:50.980
An inclusive learning atmosphere.
